			"notes": "### What's New in v2.0.2\n\n#### 1. Broadened Developer API\n- 10 new additive `GeoRestrictAPI` methods for third-party plugin integrations:\n  - Property getters: `getCountryName()`, `getAsnName()`, `isProxy()`, `isHosting()`, `isMobile()`\n  - Rule helper: `isBlocked()`\n  - Parallel batch lookups: `lookupAll(ips)`\n  - Offline cache inspection & manipulation: `getCachedCountryCode()`, `getCacheSize()`, `purgeCache()`\n\n#### 2. Private Status Dashboard\n- Token-gated `/status` endpoint on the Cloudflare Worker gateway:\n  - Live probe indicators for upstream geolocation providers, local MMDB fallback gateway, and cache tiers.\n  - Operator HTML view (or JSON with `?format=json`).\n\n#### 3. Infrastructure & Fallback Improvements\n- Integrated resilient local MMDB fallback server with automated DB-IP Lite database updates.\n- Consolidated versioning and gateway configurations across Bukkit, BungeeCord, and Velocity platforms.\n\n---\n**Supported Platforms**: Bukkit, Spigot, Paper, Purpur, Folia, BungeeCord, Waterfall, Velocity (Java 17+)"
